              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "ChristineM"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This was delicious! I quickly sauteed my asparagus. and I had no bouillon so I added a splash of chicken stock to the water (didn't really notice any difference in flavor from a regular poached egg, though). I also used pepperjack cheese. Very tasty and satisfying breakfast."
          },
          {
